"Completed Project – SMIB (https://smib.com.my/completed-project/)\nciteturn312search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; Pinnacle Kelana Jaya is a fine example how a property can be a personal and public domain concurrently. ... Sterling @ PJ ... Kelana Mahkota\n\n## Completed Project\n\nPinnacle Kelana Jaya\n\nImagePinnacle Kelana Jaya is a joint development commercial project comprising 9 units of shops and 228 units of loft office. Taking into consideration its prime location and the rising demand for multi-functional properties within Klang Valley, Pinnacle Kelana Jaya is indeed another peak of excellent lifestyle to own. With exterior that reminisces the olden days colonial structure, Pinnacle Kelana Jaya is distinctive in terms of design and build resembling the renaissance-inspired architecture, creating even more uniqueness with its urban and contemporary surrounding suggesting the clash of old and new. Reliving the prestige of its Petaling Jaya predecessor, Pinnacle Kelana Jaya is the latest landmark in the modern urban cluster of Kelana Jaya where business is elevated to a different height. Loft office features luxurious space, practical and dynamic presence add value to privileged owners. Pinnacle Kelana Jaya is a fine example how a property can be a personal and public domain concurrently. Nestled in a modern suburban within a prime location, move with ease with the impressive road and rail network that connects occupants with other locations within Klang Valley and beyond. Using LRT to avoid traffic congestion to destinations such as Central Market, Kuala Lumpur City Centre (KLCC) and Pavilion Kuala Lumpur where several shuttle-bus pick-up points are made available within the vicinity of Kelana Jaya.\n\nSterling @ PJ\n\nImageSterling@PJ is a luxury condominium featuring modern private residences. The designs of the two blocks housing 611 units are simple, pragmatic and clean. Featuring unique residences and superb amenities, it has everything for a truly comfortable lifestyle.\n\nKelana Square\n\nImageKelana Square comprises 4 completed blocks of commercial and office space with a total of 717 units. Strategically located in the heart of Kelana Jaya, it offers convenience and quality yet an affordable solution for office space needs.\n\nKelana Mahkota\n\nImageKelana Mahkota comprise 712 units in 3 blocks of residential towers, is surrounded by a host of quality community amenities and presents a delightful array of both standard units as well as luxurious duplex homes that match the opulence and spaciousness of bungalow and semi-D living.\n\nZenith Corporate Park\n\nImageZenith Corporate Park, a commercial development compriing 62 units of 3-storey shop-office, 18 units of 2-storey shop-office and 14 units 2-storey retail shop surrounded by an immediate catchment made up of high density condominiums, terrace houses, offices, shops and business centres in the vicinity. The excellent demographics with most households in the middle to upper class range form a very vibrant and large consumer market for the development.\n\nZenith Residence\n\nImageZenith Residences comprising 358 units in 2 blocks of residential towers, features the newest trend in urban living offers style and location in one comprehensive development combining offices suites, shop office and residential units. Zenith Residences is within strategic reach of everything you need for modern urban living. The project benefits from its established and commercial neighborhoods and enjoy easy access to shopping malls, specialty shops, recreational centres, parks and more.\n\nDynasty 2\n\nImageDynasty 2, a commercial development comprising 35 units of 3-storey, 22 units of 4 ½ storey shop offices and 1 block of 8 storey office blocks strategically fronting Jalan Kuchai Lama, Kuchai Entrepreneurs’ Park.\n\nDynasty 3\n\nImageDynasty 3 comprising 81 units of 2-storey and 71 units of 3-storey shop office, is adjacent to Dynasty 2, which is strategically located in the heart of bustling Kuchai Entrepreneurs’ Park.\n\nTaman Ipoh Project\n\nImageTaman Ipoh Jaya Timur 2, Phase 4S comprises 16 units of 2-storey shop-office is a new commercial development in Ipoh. It is located at the convergence of two trunk roads namely Jalan Wira Jaya and Lebuh Wira Jaya. It has the potential to become a regional commercial hub due to its ideal location.\n\nBandar Meru Raya\n\nImagePhase 7A-3 & 8A1-4 of Bandar Meru Raya residential project was the last phase undertaken by Anastoria comprises 64 units 2-storey terrace houses located between Jelapang and Chemor. Many development has occurred in this township such as Mydin Shopping Mall, new bus and taxi terminal, Casuarina Hotel and Tenby International School. Several federal government departments have also relocated to this area.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAwards & Recognition - Encorp Berhad (https://www.encorp.com.my/awards-recognition/)\nciteturn312search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 6 days ago;   * Winner of Malaysia Social Media Week 2017, Property Development ...   * Construction Industry Development Board Malaysia QLASSIC Certification 2017 for Encorp Strand Residences (72% Rating) ...   * Winner of The Edge PEPS Value Creation Excellence Award 2010 for non-residential category\n\n# AWARDS &\n\n# RECOGNITION\n\n### 2026\n\n  * Construction Industry Development Board Malaysia QLASSIC Certification 2026 for Tilia Encorp Cahaya Alam (82% Rating)\n\n### 2025\n\n  * GreenRE Award 2025 (Provisional) for\n• Balau Residences – Silver\n• Balau Residences hotel component – Gold\n\n### 2024\n\n  * Construction Industry Development Board Malaysia QLASSIC Certification 2024 for Iris Encorp Cahaya Alam (81% Rating)\n\n### 2023\n\n  * Construction Industry Development Board Malaysia QLASSIC Certification 2023 for Lily Encorp Cahaya Alam (81% Rating)\n\n### 2021\n\n  * Winner of HR Asia : Best Companies to Work for in Asia Awards 2021\n\n### 201